    mode of inversion: 1=full MT, 2=deviatoric MT (recommended), 3= DC MT, 4=known fixed DC MT
1
    time step of XXXRAW.DAT files (in sec)
0.3
    number of trial source positions (isourmax), max. 51
1
    trial time shifts (max. 100 shifts): from (>-3500), step, to (<3500)
    example: -10,5,50 means -10dt to 50dt, step = 5dt, i.e. 12 shifts
-7 1 7
    number of subevents to be searched (isubmax), 
1
    filter (f1,f2,f3,f4); flat band-pass between f2, f3
    cosine tapered between f1, f2 and between f3, f4
0.03 0.03 0.06 0.06
    guess of data variance (important only for absolute value of the parameter variance)
5.023290e-10
